 your dealer portal administrator with\n\t\t\tpurchasing rights so they can register on your behalf. Once you have been registered, come back to this page to begin the courses.</p>\n\t</div>\n\t\x3c!--User registered, training incomplete--\x3e\n\t<div style="display:none">\n\t\t<div class="alert alert-warning" style="background-color: #fff;"\n\t\t\t *ngIf="myC4CTInfo.currentStatus >= 10 && myC4CTInfo.currentStatus < 20">\n\t\t\t<h4>\n\t\t\t\t<span *ngIf="!showBakpakCodes && myC4CTInfo.currentStatus == 10 && !beganCourses">Prepare For the C4CT Courses</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span *ngIf="!showBakpakCodes && myC4CTInfo.currentStatus >= 15 && !beganCourses">Begin Courses</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span *ngIf="!showBakpakCodes && beganCourses">Continue C4CT Courses</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span *ngIf="showBakpakCodes">Congratulations!</span>\n\t\t\t</h4>\n\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t<span *ngIf="!showBakpakCodes && myC4CTInfo.currentStatus == 10 && !beganCourses">You are registered for C4CT training and your box of network\n\t\t\t\t\tequipment will ship soon. Please wait until your C4CT network equipment has arrived before starting the courses.&nbsp;</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span *ngIf="!showBakpakCodes && myC4CTInfo.currentStatus >= 15 && !beganCourses">Your C4CT kit has been shipped. Once you have received it, you\n\t\t\t\t\tcan access the course material on the Education Portal.&nbsp;</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span *ngIf="!showBakpakCodes && beganCourses">You can access the course material on the Education Portal.&nbsp;</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span *ngIf="showBakpakCodes">You have successfully completed Course 4 - Wireless Access Points of your C4CT certification. To proceed with\n\t\t\t\t\tCourse 5 - Remote Monitoring &amp; Management, you must register for a Pakedge BakPak account. Please use the unique C4CT Technician code\n\t\t\t\t\tbelow to register your account on the Pakedge BakPak website to begin Course 5 - Remote Monitoring &amp; Management.&nbsp;</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span *ngIf="myC4CTInfo.currentStatus !== 10">{{rebateMessage}}</span>\n\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t<c4-my-bakpak *ngIf="showBakpakCodes" [hideAccount]="true"></c4-my-bakpak>\n\t\t\t<ul *ngIf="myC4CTInfo.courses.length" class="no-style half-margin-bottom">\n\t\t\t\t<li *ngFor="let course of myC4CTInfo.courses; let i = index;">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a [href]="course.url" class="text-dark">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<i *ngIf="course.completed" class="fal fa-check-circle text-success"></i>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<i *ngIf="course.status === \'in_progress\' || (i === 0 && course.status === \'not_started\')"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t   class="fal fa-arrow-circle-right text-warning"></i>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<i *ngIf="course.status === \'not_started\' && i > 0" class="fal fa-circle text-white"></i> {{course.name}} </a>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t<a class="c4btn" [href]="learningPathUrl">{{trainingButtonText}}</a>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\x3c!--User registered, training complete, test not scheduled--\x3e\n\t\t<div class="alert alert-warning" style="background-color: #fff;" *ngIf="myC4CTInfo.currentStatus == 20">\n\t\t\t<h4>Schedule C4CT Certification Exam</h4>\n\t\t\t<p>Your training is complete! Please schedule your certification exam as soon as possible. {{rebateMessage}} </p>\n\t\t\t<ul *ngIf="myC4CTInfo.courses.length" class="no-style half-margin-bottom">\n\t\t\t\t<li *ngFor="let course of myC4CTInfo.courses; let i = index;">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a [href]="course.url" class="text-dark">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<i *ngIf="course.completed" class="fal fa-check-circle text-success"></i>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<i *ngIf="course.status === \'in_progress\' || (i === 0 && course.status === \'not_started\')"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t   class="fal fa-arrow-circle-right text-warning"></i>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<i *ngIf="course.status === \'not_started\' && i > 0" class="fal fa-circle text-white"></i> {{course.name}} </a>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t<c4-proctor-u [disableScheduleExam]="disableScheduleExam" buttonText="Schedule Exam"></c4-proctor-u>\n\t\t\t<a class="c4btn grey" [href]="learningPathUrl">Review C4CT Courses</a>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\x3c!--User registered, test scheduled, Exam not started--\x3e\n\t\t<div class="alert alert-warning" style="background-color: #fff;"\n\t\t\t *ngIf="(myC4CTInfo.currentStatus == 30 && (!myC4CTInfo.examPartOne || (myC4CTInfo.examPartOne && !myC4CTInfo.examPartOne.completed)))">\n\t\t\t<h4>Take C4CT Certification Exam</h4>\n\t\t\t<p>Your exam has been scheduled. You can access your proctoring session or the exam below. {{rebateMessage}} </p>\n\t\t\t<c4-proctor-u *ngIf="!myC4CTInfo.examPartOne" buttonText="Begin Proctoring"></c4-proctor-u>\n\t\t\t<a class="c4btn" href="https://control4.learnupon.com/dashboard?display=my_courses"\n\t\t\t   *ngIf="trainingButtonText">{{trainingButtonText}}</a>\n\t\t\t<a class="c4btn grey" [href]="learningPathUrl">Review C4CT Courses</a>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\x3c!--User registered, test scheduled, Exam Part One failed--\x3e\n\t\t<div class="alert alert-warning" style="background-color: #fff;"\n\t\t\t *ngIf="(myC4CTInfo.currentStatus == 30 && myC4CTInfo.examPartOne && myC4CTInfo.examPartOne.completed && !myC4CTInfo.examPartOne.passed)">\n\t\t\t<h4>Exam Progress</h4>\n\t\t\t<p>Sorry, you did not successfully pass Part 1 of the C4CT exam. Therefore, you cannot proceed to Part 2. Please schedule another Exam Session.\n\t\t\t\t{{rebateMessage}}</p>\n\t\t\t<c4-proctor-u buttonText="Re-schedule Exam"></c4-proctor-u>\n\t\t\t<a class="c4btn grey" [href]="learningPathUrl">Review C4CT Courses</a>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\x3c!--User registered, test scheduled, Exam Part One passed--\x3e\n\t\t<div class="alert alert-warning" style="background-color: #fff;"\n\t\t\t *ngIf="(myC4CTInfo.currentStatus == 30 && myC4CTInfo.examPartOne && myC4CTInfo.examPartOne.passed)">\n\t\t\t<h4>Congratulations</h4>\n\t\t\t<p>You have successfully passed Part 1 of the C4CT Exam. Begin Part 2 of the Exam. {{rebateMessage}}</p>\n\t\t\t<a class="c4btn" href="https://control4.learnupon.com/dashboard?display=my_courses">Take Exam Part 2</a>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\x3c!--User registered, test comlete, not graded--\x3e\n\t\t<div class="alert alert-warning" style="background-color: #fff;" *ngIf="myC4CTInfo.currentStatus == 35">\n\t\t\t<h4>Exam Complete</h4>\n\t\t\t<p>You have completed Part 1 and Part 2 of the C4CT exam. Your exam is currently being reviewed.</p>\n\t\t\t<a class="c4btn grey" [href]="learningPathUrl">Review C4CT Courses</a>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\x3c!--User registered, test failed--\x3e\n\t\t<div class="alert alert-warning" style="background-color: #fff;" *ngIf="myC4CTInfo.currentStatus == 40">\n\t\t\t<h4>Re-schedule C4CT Certification Exam</h4>\n\t\t\t<p>You may retake the certification exam by scheduling another exam. Please note that a retake exam may result in a small fee. {{rebateMessage}}</p>\n\t\t\t<c4-proctor-u buttonText="Re-schedule Exam"></c4-proctor-u>\n\t\t\t<a class="c4btn grey" [href]="learningPathUrl">Review C4CT Courses</a>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\x3c!--Certified--\x3e\n\t\t<div class="alert alert-success" *ngIf="myC4CTInfo.currentStatus == 50">\n\t\t\t<h4>Congratulations!</h4>\n\t\t\t<p>It\u2019s official. You are a Professional Certified Network Administrator (C4CT).</p>\n\t\t\t<a class="c4btn" href="../education">See Your Certificate</a>\n\t\t\t<a class="c4btn grey" [href]="learningPathUrl">Review C4CT Courses</a>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>'},Ch6e:function(t,e){t.exports='<div class="row no-margin">\n\t<div class="col-sm-6 background"\n\t\tstyle="height: 300px; background-image: url(//res.cloudinary.com/control4/image/upload/static-pages/showroom/posters-ht.jpg);">\n\t\t<div id="posterlifestyle" class="background-clickable" [class.active]="display === \'lifestyle\'"\n\t\t\t(click)="showLifeStyle()" trackCategory="Showroom Posters" trackLabel="showLifeStyle" c4Track="Tab">\n\t\t\t<div class="vertically-center text-white text-center">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class="uppercase text-white">Lifestyle</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<span class="round-icon-outline"><i class="fal fa-chevron-down"></i></span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class="col-