received it, you can\n\t\t\t\taccess the course material on the Education Portal.&nbsp;</span>\n\t\t\t<span *ngIf="!showBakpakCodes && beganCourses">You can access the course material on the Education Portal.&nbsp;</span>\n\t\t\t<span *ngIf="showBakpakCodes">You have successfully completed Course 4 - Wireless Access Points of your PCNA certification. To proceed with Course 5\n\t\t\t\t- Remote Monitoring &amp; Management, you must register for a Pakedge BakPak account. Please use the unique PCNA Technician code below to\n\t\t\t\tregister your account on the Pakedge BakPak website to begin Course 5 - Remote Monitoring &amp; Management.&nbsp;</span>\n\t\t\t<span *ngIf="myPcnaInfo.currentStatus !== 10">{{rebateMessage}}</span>\n\t\t</p>\n\t\t<c4-my-bakpak *ngIf="showBakpakCodes" [hideAccount]="true"></c4-my-bakpak>\n\t\t<ul *ngIf="myPcnaInfo.courses.length" class="no-style half-margin-bottom">\n\t\t\t<li *ngFor="let course of myPcnaInfo.courses; let i = index;">\n\t\t\t\t<a [href]="course.url" class="text-dark">\n\t\t\t\t\t<i *ngIf="course.completed" class="fal fa-check-circle text-success"></i>\n\t\t\t\t\t<i *ngIf="course.status === \'in_progress\' || (i === 0 && course.status === \'not_started\')"\n\t\t\t\t\t   class="fal fa-arrow-circle-right text-warning"></i>\n\t\t\t\t\t<i *ngIf="course.status === \'not_started\' && i > 0" class="fal fa-circle text-white"></i> {{course.name}} </a>\n\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t\t<a class="c4btn" [href]="learningPathUrl">{{trainingButtonText}}</a>\n\t</div>\n\t\x3c!--User registered, training complete, test not scheduled--\x3e\n\t<div class="alert alert-warning" style="background-color: #fff;" *ngIf="myPcnaInfo.currentStatus == 20">\n\t\t<h4>Schedule PCNA Certification Exam</h4>\n\t\t<p>Your training is complete! Please schedule your certification exam as soon as possible. {{rebateMessage}} </p>\n\t\t<ul *ngIf="myPcnaInfo.courses.length" class="no-style half-margin-bottom">\n\t\t\t<li *ngFor="let course of myPcnaInfo.courses; let i = index;">\n\t\t\t\t<a [href]="course.url" class="text-dark">\n\t\t\t\t\t<i *ngIf="course.completed" class="fal fa-check-circle text-success"></i>\n\t\t\t\t\t<i *ngIf="course.status === \'in_progress\' || (i === 0 && course.status === \'not_started\')"\n\t\t\t\t\t   class="fal fa-arrow-circle-right text-warning"></i>\n\t\t\t\t\t<i *ngIf="course.status === \'not_started\' && i > 0" class="fal fa-circle text-white"></i> {{course.name}} </a>\n\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t\t<c4-proctor-u [disableScheduleExam]="disableScheduleExam" buttonText="Schedule Exam"></c4-proctor-u>\n\t\t<a class="c4btn grey" [href]="learningPathUrl">Review PCNA Courses</a>\n\t</div>\n\t\x3c!--User registered, test scheduled, Exam not started--\x3e\n\t<div class="alert alert-warning" style="background-color: #fff;"\n\t\t *ngIf="(myPcnaInfo.currentStatus == 30 && (!myPcnaInfo.examPartOne || (myPcnaInfo.examPartOne && !myPcnaInfo.examPartOne.completed)))">\n\t\t<h4>Take PCNA Certification Exam</h4>\n\t\t<p>Your exam has been scheduled. You can access your proctoring session or the exam below. {{rebateMessage}} </p>\n\t\t<c4-proctor-u *ngIf="!myPcnaInfo.examPartOne" buttonText="Begin Proctoring"></c4-proctor-u>\n\t\t<a class="c4btn" href="https://control4.learnupon.com/dashboard?display=my_courses"\n\t\t   *ngIf="trainingButtonText">{{trainingButtonText}}</a>\n\t\t<a class="c4btn grey" [href]="learningPathUrl">Review PCNA Courses</a>\n\t</div>\n\t\x3c!--User registered, test scheduled, Exam Part One failed--\x3e\n\t<div class="alert alert-warning" style="background-color: #fff;"\n\t\t *ngIf="(myPcnaInfo.currentStatus == 30 && myPcnaInfo.examPartOne && myPcnaInfo.examPartOne.completed && !myPcnaInfo.examPartOne.passed)">\n\t\t<h4>Exam Progress</h4>\n\t\t<p>Sorry, you did not successfully pass Part 1 of the PCNA exam. Therefore, you cannot proceed to Part 2. Please schedule another Exam Session.\n\t\t\t{{rebateMessage}}</p>\n\t\t<c4-proctor-u buttonText="Re-schedule Exam"></c4-proctor-u>\n\t\t<a class="c4btn grey" [href]="learningPathUrl">Review PCNA Courses</a>\n\t</div>\n\t\x3c!--User registered, test scheduled, Exam Part One passed--\x3e\n\t<div class="alert alert-warning" style="background-color: #fff;"\n\t\t *ngIf="(myPcnaInfo.currentStatus == 30 && myPcnaInfo.examPartOne && myPcnaInfo.examPartOne.passed)">\n\t\t<h4>Congratulations</h4>\n\t\t<p>You have successfully passed Part 1 of the PCNA Exam. Begin Part 2 of the Exam. {{rebateMessage}}</p>\n\t\t<a class="c4btn" href="https://control4.learnupon.com/dashboard?display=my_courses">Take Exam Part 2</a>\n\t</div>\n\t\x3c!--User registered, test comlete, not graded--\x3e\n\t<div class="alert alert-warning" style="background-color: #fff;" *ngIf="myPcnaInfo.currentStatus == 35">\n\t\t<h4>Exam Complete</h4>\n\t\t<p>You have completed Part 1 and Part 2 of the PCNA exam. Your exam is currently being reviewed.</p>\n\t\t<a class="c4btn grey" [href]="learningPathUrl">Review PCNA Courses</a>\n\t</div>\n\t\x3c!--User registered, test failed--\x3e\n\t<div class="alert alert-warning" style="background-color: #fff;" *ngIf="myPcnaInfo.currentStatus == 40">\n\t\t<h4>Re-schedule PCNA Certification Exam</h4>\n\t\t<p>You may retake the certification exam by scheduling another exam. Please note that a retake exam may result in a small fee. {{rebateMessage}}</p>\n\t\t<c4-proctor-u buttonText="Re-schedule Exam"></c4-proctor-u>\n\t\t<a class="c4btn grey" [href]="learningPathUrl">Review PCNA Courses</a>\n\t</div>\n\t\x3c!--Certified--\x3e\n\t<div class="alert alert-success" *ngIf="myPcnaInfo.currentStatus == 50">\n\t\t<h4>Congratulations!</h4>\n\t\t<p>It\u2019s official. You are a Professional Certified Network Administrator (PCNA).</p>\n\t\t<a class="c4btn" href="../education">See Your Certificate</a>\n\t\t<a class="c4btn grey" [href]="learningPathUrl">Review PCNA Courses</a>\n\t</div>\n</div>'},Xkmh:function(t,e){t.exports='<c4-loading *ngIf="loading"></c4-loading>\n<div *ngIf="videos?.length">\n\t<div class="row">\n\t\t<div class="col